OL,3,GNEWSAThe Darkness to headline festival
OL,4,Aas homecoming gig
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "We're coming home! Well, very
OL,7,Fnearly. Norwich is close enough to
OL,8,FLowestoft for us to consider this a
OL,9,Fhomecoming, and what better way to do
OL,10,Fit than under a giant circus tent with
OL,11,Fan absolutely outrageous collection of
OL,12,Frock bands?"
